00:03:10.345 --> 00:03:13.695
Now, I will go through my top 5 favourite class 1-A students

00:03:13.695 --> 00:03:16.715
and my top 5 least favourite students.

00:03:16.715 --> 00:03:19.845
Now, this is extremely hard because, there are so many

00:03:19.845 --> 00:03:22.585
likeable characters in this class

00:03:22.585 --> 00:03:25.335
but, i'm going to take a crack at it anyways.

00:03:25.335 --> 00:03:28.585
My 5th favourite student is Bakugou. There is something I love about

00:03:28.585 --> 00:03:31.615
Bakugou. He is unapologetically an asshole

00:03:31.615 --> 00:03:34.395
almost all of the time. He stands out in a class

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.455
that's well behaved and has good manners for the most part.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.440
With his cockyness

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.505
and his complete disregard seidel expectations for how

00:03:42.505 --> 00:03:45.525
one should behave. He serves as a character foiled for

00:03:45.525 --> 00:03:48.655
our protagonist who tends to be less confident more apologetic

00:03:48.655 --> 00:03:51.535
but also nicer to those around him.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.345
Bakugou is explosive in every way.

00:03:54.345 --> 00:03:57.600
He stands out and he's never boring.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.620
Furthermore, because he can so closed off when he does for a

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:03.920
friendship with Kirishima it is

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:07.100
all the more rewarding. He isn't a bad guy really.

00:04:07.125 --> 00:04:09.995
That was proven when the League of Villains

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.020
unsuccessfully tried to turn him into one of them.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.740
He is good at heart. He just speaks his mind

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:18.645
and refuses to play nice. There is something very

00:04:18.645 --> 00:04:21.355
appealing about that. Especially because

00:04:21.355 --> 00:04:24.285
that kind of behaviour is so rare among

00:04:24.285 --> 00:04:27.305
his fellow students. My 4th favourite student

00:04:27.305 --> 00:04:30.495
is Momo. She really is the whole package. She has

00:04:30.495 --> 00:04:33.675
mad genius level intellect, an amazing quirk,

00:04:33.735 --> 00:04:36.715
all the money in the world and yet she somehow

00:04:36.715 --> 00:04:38.985
avoids the trap of being stuck up.

00:04:39.305 --> 00:04:41.445
If anything one of her main

00:04:41.445 --> 00:04:44.565
challenges is overcoming her own insecurities

00:04:44.565 --> 00:04:46.340
and feelings of unworthiness.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.260
To boot. She loves reading

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.140
which is probably my favourite pastime.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:54.400
It also doesn't hurt that she is one of the best examples of

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:58.020
fan service done right in anime. Horikoshi

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:00.680
came up with the clever reason for her to be close to naked

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:03.080
all of the time and so

00:05:03.085 --> 00:05:05.955
the fan service actually makes sense in the story and if it's

00:05:05.955 --> 00:05:08.625
still wasn't blatantly obvious,

00:05:08.625 --> 00:05:11.575
I am totally a fan of the service.

00:05:11.575 --> 00:05:14.445
Can't save a bad show but, it can be the

00:05:14.445 --> 00:05:17.245
perfect icing on the top of a good show,

00:05:17.245 --> 00:05:20.255
and Momo makes for some quality icing.
( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)

00:05:20.255 --> 00:05:22.325
My third favourite student goes by

00:05:22.325 --> 00:05:24.905
many aliases including manly for all and

00:05:25.125 --> 00:05:27.395
hard for all. He is the metapod of

00:05:27.395 --> 00:05:29.895
Mha. He is Kirishima.

00:05:29.895 --> 00:05:32.925
A manly man, overflowing with manliness.

00:05:32.925 --> 00:05:36.035
I recently made a video 10 facts

00:05:36.035 --> 00:05:39.225
you didn't know about Kirishima and in that video

00:05:39.225 --> 00:05:42.235
I explained that Kirishima's evolution is my favourite thing about him

00:05:42.235 --> 00:05:44.435
and I don't mean his evolution into a Butterfree.

00:05:44.435 --> 00:05:47.325
Kirishima started out as a quiet kid

00:05:47.325 --> 00:05:50.175
who didn't stand out and froze in the face of danger.

00:05:50.175 --> 00:05:52.695
However, after being inspired

00:05:52.695 --> 00:05:55.375
by people like Mina and his favourite

00:05:55.375 --> 00:05:57.845
pro hero Crimson Riot. He decided that despite his

00:05:57.845 --> 00:06:00.985
unflashy quirk, plain looking appearance and overwhelming

00:06:00.985 --> 00:06:03.800
fear, he would change himself and become

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.920
a hero. (Kiri Lub) I love that his favourite hero is Crimson Riot and

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.515
not All Might, because it makes Kirishima

00:06:09.515 --> 00:06:12.565
more original since at some point it seems like All Might

00:06:12.565 --> 00:06:15.075
is everyone's favourite hero. So

00:06:15.075 --> 00:06:18.215
his backstory was very refreshing for that reason. Furthermore

00:06:18.215 --> 00:06:21.415
the fact that he wasn't born like Mina and Deku

00:06:21.415 --> 00:06:24.165
and act without thinking when others are in trouble but

00:06:24.195 --> 00:06:27.175
had to consciously change and improve himself also makes

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:30.285
him one of the most inspirational characters

00:06:30.285 --> 00:06:33.240
in the show for me. He is a relatable character

00:06:33.245 --> 00:06:36.180
and truly a great role model.

00:06:36.185 --> 00:06:39.335
My second favourite character in the show and best girl of all

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:40.380
in my opinion.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:49.120
Is Tsuyu. I said before that Momo was the the complete package but paradoxically her perfection holds her back from being even more likable.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:51.560
Tsuyu is quirky. She is not what you'd expect

00:06:51.565 --> 00:06:54.445
from a conventional best girl

00:06:54.445 --> 00:06:57.605
and that's what I really love about her character. I gotta say

00:06:57.605 --> 00:07:00.555
that I do not particularly like frogs in fact

00:07:00.555 --> 00:07:03.485
they always kinda grossed me out so it's even more

00:07:03.485 --> 00:07:06.495
impressive that Horikoshi made a frog like character

00:07:06.495 --> 00:07:09.055
that I like as much as I do.

00:07:09.055 --> 00:07:12.135
Her design is just unique and awesome in my opinion. She's

00:07:12.135 --> 00:07:15.015
not the most talented person including socially

00:07:15.015 --> 00:07:17.855
but like Kirishima she takes conscious

00:07:17.855 --> 00:07:20.865
steps to overcome her weaknesses and make friends.

00:07:20.865 --> 00:07:23.960
Where as Momo had a rich pampered upbringing

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.860
Tsuyu was taking care of her little siblings.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:29.775
Tsuyu's life was never easy but she still remains a positive

00:07:29.775 --> 00:07:32.755
person plus she's just like

00:07:32.755 --> 00:07:35.145
the cutest thing ever and no one

00:07:35.145 --> 00:07:37.935
can deny this. Next, my number one favourite

00:07:37.935 --> 00:07:40.655
character is Sticky Balls

00:07:40.655 --> 00:07:43.595
for all aka Mineta. (Get out)

00:07:43.595 --> 00:07:45.955
Yes, the perverted man in diapers

00:07:45.955 --> 00:07:48.905
is my favourite character. I like a lot of quote on quote

00:07:48.905 --> 00:07:52.015
perverted characters in anime like Sanji from One Piece

00:07:52.015 --> 00:07:54.815
and Jiraiya from Naruto. In the super pc

00:07:54.815 --> 00:07:57.855
age we live in it's actually refreshing seeing

00:07:57.855 --> 00:07:59.995
a dude so unashamedly

00:07:59.995 --> 00:08:01.425
attracted to girls.

00:08:01.855 --> 00:08:04.845
Yes, I know a lot of people hate Mineta but that only

00:08:04.845 --> 00:08:06.675
makes me like him all the more.

00:08:07.115 --> 00:08:10.095
In true all dudes have an inter pervert.

00:08:10.095 --> 00:08:13.155
Including Horikoshi. Mineta is just more open about

00:08:13.155 --> 00:08:15.575
it. Then some. So yes,

00:08:15.575 --> 00:08:18.365
I believe that Mineta is the perverted hero

00:08:18.365 --> 00:08:21.305
we all deserve. Know if that wasn't controversial

00:08:21.305 --> 00:08:24.165
enough next i'm going to tread even

00:08:24.165 --> 00:08:27.235
more dangerous territory I'm going to share my top 5 least

00:08:27.235 --> 00:08:30.175
favourite characters. Before picking up your pitchforks

00:08:30.175 --> 00:08:33.185
remember that this is just my subjective opinion.

00:08:33.185 --> 00:08:36.195
If I happen to list one of your favourite characters

00:08:36.195 --> 00:08:38.485
feel free to tell me why

00:08:38.485 --> 00:08:41.215
you personally like them in the comments

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:43.540
and keep in mind that I don't hate these characters

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.400
I just prefer the others in

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:49.540
the class more. Now, may god help us

00:08:49.555 --> 00:08:52.775
as I begin my trek across mine filled territory.

00:08:52.775 --> 00:08:55.295
My 5th least favourite character is

00:08:55.605 --> 00:08:58.605
the class President himself, Iida. (Grabs pitchfork)

00:08:58.605 --> 00:09:01.775
I think his costume is pretty cool as so is his quirk.

00:09:01.775 --> 00:09:04.505
But as a character he is kinda boring for me compared to

00:09:04.505 --> 00:09:07.505
the the others in the class. He seems like a stand up

00:09:07.505 --> 00:09:10.235
responsible guy who follows the rules. To be fair

00:09:10.235 --> 00:09:13.305
this was complicated during the Stain Arc when

00:09:13.305 --> 00:09:15.885
Iida chose to break the rules and go after Stain

00:09:15.885 --> 00:09:18.225
to avenge his brother and when Iida

00:09:18.225 --> 00:09:21.145
followed the others to go save Bakugou which is why he isn't

00:09:21.145 --> 00:09:23.715
lower down on this list

00:09:23.715 --> 00:09:26.545
but he quickly seems to revert back to his normal self

00:09:26.555 --> 00:09:29.735
after these few rule breaking incidences. Even without

00:09:29.735 --> 00:09:32.725
the Bakugou incident he did not want anyone to

00:09:32.725 --> 00:09:36.105
go and only came along so he could get everyone out of there

00:09:36.105 --> 00:09:39.025
if there was serious trouble. I much prefered

00:09:39.025 --> 00:09:41.855
Kirishima's response for him there

00:09:41.855 --> 00:09:44.905
was no question that he was gonna try to save his friend.

00:09:44.905 --> 00:09:47.915
The rules be damned. In short

00:09:47.915 --> 00:09:50.145
I think Iida is a great guy but,

00:09:50.145 --> 00:09:53.325
that doesn't translate into an enjoyable character for me.

00:09:53.325 --> 00:09:56.535
My 4th least favourite character is Sero. Sero

00:09:56.535 --> 00:09:59.955
hasn't been fleshed out to much. He's an extra as

00:10:00.015 --> 00:10:02.705
Bakugou would say, who is constantly smiling

00:10:02.705 --> 00:10:05.365
his slightly unsettling smile. (His smile is beautiful) Besides

00:10:05.365 --> 00:10:07.905
being a reference to spiderman, and

00:10:07.905 --> 00:10:10.965
having similar powers, which is pretty cool,

00:10:10.965 --> 00:10:13.635
Sero doesn't really stand out to me in any

00:10:13.635 --> 00:10:16.625
significant way. I'm not crazy about his character design

00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:18.155
and we don't know well

00:10:18.155 --> 00:10:21.155
enough for me to care much about him at this point.

00:10:21.155 --> 00:10:24.035
My 3rd least favourite character is Koda know again,

00:10:24.035 --> 00:10:26.875
we have a guy with a quirk that I like, being

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:30.080
able to control animals has such badass potential

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:33.035
and Koda could one day grow into a

00:10:33.035 --> 00:10:35.785
great hero and interesting character but he

00:10:35.785 --> 00:10:38.745
has a ways to go. It doesn't help that the

00:10:38.745 --> 00:10:41.545
sighting of the storying doesn't usually offer a wide selection of cool

00:10:41.545 --> 00:10:44.215
animals for Koda to utilize nor does it

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:47.520
help that Koda die from a heart attack if he

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.225
ever watched Shino reck the sound ninja in

00:10:50.225 --> 00:10:53.155
early Naruto. He's a shy dude. Who

00:10:53.155 --> 00:10:55.805
doesn't stand out and hasn't gotten a lot of

00:10:55.805 --> 00:10:58.835
screen time so far but, if he actually turned out

00:10:58.835 --> 00:11:01.835
to be the U.A. traitor I might just have to re

00:11:01.835 --> 00:11:03.935
evaluate my opinion about him. My

00:11:03.935 --> 00:11:06.835
2nd least favourite character is Sato. Diabetes

00:11:06.835 --> 00:11:09.725
for all is the muscle head of class 1-A.

00:11:09.725 --> 00:11:12.605
Besides not being a great role model for kids,

00:11:12.605 --> 00:11:15.880
his cognate(?) goes down when he's fighting

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.880
Meaning we probably can't expect to see

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:22.180
any interesting strategic fights from him in the future

00:11:22.185 --> 00:11:25.415
and my least favourite character at the moment

00:11:25.415 --> 00:11:28.575
is Ojiro the man with a tail.

00:11:28.575 --> 00:11:31.615
Like I said he is a reference to Luke Skywalker and hopefully

00:11:31.615 --> 00:11:34.695
that doesn't foreshadow All for One cutting off his tail but,

00:11:34.925 --> 00:11:37.345
that reference does make me like him any

00:11:37.345 --> 00:11:40.265
more, especially since i'm not personally

00:11:40.265 --> 00:11:43.185
a huge fan of Star Wars to begin with. His design stands out

00:11:43.185 --> 00:11:46.225
less then that of the previously mentioned characters

00:11:46.225 --> 00:11:48.735
and he doesn't even provide some of the comedic potential

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:51.800
that Sato does. It also doesn't help that the most

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:54.635
significant thing he has done is get brainwashed

00:11:54.635 --> 00:11:57.635
and that is it guys like I said these opinions

00:11:57.635 --> 00:12:01.035
could change as we get more information about class 1-A but,

00:12:01.125 --> 00:12:03.775
those are my thoughts at this time tell me who

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.980
your favourite and least favourite characters are in the comments below

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:12.800
and why if you guys enjoy this type of video and want to see more of them in the future definitely

